<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);OPENAI001</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!--
      GRAFO DESTE PROJETO - dono unico: o Microsoft Agent Framework
      ============================================================
        Microsoft.Agents.AI.Foundry (prerelease)   -> Microsoft.Agents.AI, Azure.AI.Projects,
                                                      Microsoft.Extensions.AI(.OpenAI), OpenAI
        Azure.Identity 1.21.0                       (DefaultAzureCredential)

      Telemetria (nenhum deles traz o pacote OpenAI):
        OpenTelemetry                               (TracerProvider)
        Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter        (exporta para o Application Insights)

      Avaliacao (falam com o modelo por IChatClient - tambem nao trazem OpenAI):
        Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Evaluation
        Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Evaluation.Quality

      ATENCAO ao ultimo par: eles dependem de Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions e
      precisam bater com a versao que o MAF resolveu. Se o restore acusar NU1605/NU1608,
      alinhe a versao dos dois pacotes de avaliacao a de Microsoft.Extensions.AI exibida
      por `dotnet list package` com a opcao include-transitive. Nao mexa no MAF.
      (Um comentario XML nao pode conter dois hifens seguidos, por isso a opcao
      nao aparece escrita aqui.)

      Diagnostico:  dotnet nuget why <este csproj> OpenAI
    -->
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Agents.AI.Foundry" Version="1.*-*" />
    <PackageReference Include="Azure.Identity" Version="1.21.0" />

    <PackageReference Include="OpenTelemetry" Version="1.*" />
    <PackageReference Include="Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter" Version="1.*" />

    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Evaluation" Version="10.9.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Evaluation.Quality" Version="10.9.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
